    <p><strong>We're building the most honest, data-driven AI tool reviews for developers and engineers.</strong></p>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>In a world flooded with AI hype and marketing spin, we cut through the noise with real benchmarks, actual code tests, and unfiltered opinions. No sponsorships. No affiliate links. Just raw data and honest assessments.</p>

    <h2>What We Do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Head-to-head comparisons</strong> — We pit AI models against each other in real-world coding scenarios</li>
      <li><strong>Benchmark deep dives</strong> — MMLU, HumanEval, custom tests — we run them all</li>
      <li><strong>API analysis</strong> — Rate limits, latency, pricing, SDK quality — the stuff vendors don't highlight</li>
      <li><strong>Tool reviews</strong> — IDE agents, code generators, debugging assistants — tested in actual workflows</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How We Test</h2>
    <p>Every review goes through our rigorous testing process:</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Real-world tasks</strong> — Not synthetic benchmarks alone. We test with actual codebases, real bugs, genuine production scenarios.</li>
      <li><strong>Multiple iterations</strong> — We don't judge on first attempts. We track improvement across retries.</li>
      <li><strong>Time tracking</strong> — Speed matters. We measure how long each tool takes to complete tasks.</li>
      <li><strong>Cost analysis</strong> — Token usage, API costs, hidden fees — we break down the real economics.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Our Standards</h2>
    <blockquote>
      <p>If we can't back it with data, we don't claim it. If we haven't tested it ourselves, we say so.</p>
    </blockquote>

    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
    <p>Have a tool you want us to review? Found an error in our benchmarks? Want to collaborate on a deep dive? Reach out — we read everything.</p>

